Quantum Reservoir Simulation for Geothermal & CO₂ Sequestration

Copyright 2026 Infosys Limited

Developed by Rishab Ghosh.

This repository contains research code, proof-of-concept implementations,
and supporting material exploring hybrid quantum-classical approaches for
reservoir simulation, uncertainty quantification, and optimization in
geothermal energy and carbon capture & storage applications.

The corresponding use case has been included in the Open Quantum Institute
(OQI) Use Case Repository hosted at CERN under the contributor organization
Infosys.

